    "details": "<p><strong data-start=\"29\" data-end=\"46\">SGU Hackx 1.0</strong> is a <strong data-start=\"52\" data-end=\"88\">36-hour national-level hackathon</strong> organized by the <strong data-start=\"106\" data-end=\"165\">School of Computer Applications, SDGI Global University</strong>, in collaboration with <strong data-start=\"189\" data-end=\"222\">TechSpire Global Technologies</strong>.</p>\n<p>The hackathon brings together passionate students, developers, innovators, and problem-solvers to build innovative technology-driven solutions to real-world challenges. Participants will work in teams, develop their ideas, and showcase their projects before a panel of judges.</p>\n<p><strong data-start=\"503\" data-end=\"522\">What to Expect:</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"523\" data-end=\"867\">\n<li data-section-id=\"1jv0ndb\" data-start=\"523\" data-end=\"574\">36 hours of continuous innovation and development</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"r12tgg\" data-start=\"575\" data-end=\"606\">Real-world problem statements</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"5hwgkl\" data-start=\"607\" data-end=\"648\">Team-based coding and solution building</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1bn9p4b\" data-start=\"649\" data-end=\"684\">Mentorship and technical guidance</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"j78ed9\" data-start=\"685\" data-end=\"734\">Project evaluation by industry/academic experts</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"drntno\" data-start=\"735\" data-end=\"770\">Networking with fellow innovators</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"14pil35\" data-start=\"771\" data-end=\"805\">Certificates and exciting prizes</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"m6oa6w\" data-start=\"806\" data-end=\"867\">Opportunity to showcase your project on a national platform</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong data-start=\"869\" data-end=\"879\">Theme:</strong> Innovation &bull; Technology &bull; Problem Solving &bull; Entrepreneurship</p>\n<p><strong data-start=\"942\" data-end=\"1015\" data-is-last-node=\"\">Get ready to code, create, collaborate, and compete at SGU HACKX 1.0.</strong></p>",
